
@host = http://localhost:5324
@contentType = application/json

### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### 0. 健康检查
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### 0.1 轻量健康检查（不连 Ollama，纯返回配置）
GET {{host}}/api/health
Accept: application/json

### 0.2 深度健康检查（尝试列出 Ollama 本地模型）
GET {{host}}/api/health/deep
Accept: application/json


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### 1. 非流式对话 POST /api/chat
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### 1.1 最简调用：只传 message，服务端自动生成 sessionId
POST {{host}}/api/chat
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "message": "你好，用一句话介绍你自己"
}

### 1.2 显式指定 sessionId（多轮对话起点）
# @name chatTurn1
POST {{host}}/api/chat
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "message": "我叫小明，请记住我的名字",
  "sessionId": "demo-001"
}

### 1.3 第二轮：复用同一 sessionId，验证上下文记忆
POST {{host}}/api/chat
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "message": "我叫什么名字？",
  "sessionId": "demo-001"
}

### 1.4 指定模型（覆盖 AgentOptions.ChatModel）
POST {{host}}/api/chat
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "message": "用 JSON 格式输出三个水果名",
  "sessionId": "demo-002",
  "model": "qwen3:4b"
}

### 1.5 空消息：应返回 400
POST {{host}}/api/chat
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "message": ""
}


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### 2. 流式对话 POST /api/chat/stream (SSE)
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### 2.1 基础流式：逐块返回 data: {...}
POST {{host}}/api/chat/stream
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Accept: text/event-stream

{
  "message": "用三句话介绍一下上海",
  "sessionId": "stream-001"
}

### 2.2 带模型的流式
POST {{host}}/api/chat/stream
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Accept: text/event-stream

{
  "message": "写一首四行小诗",
  "sessionId": "stream-002",
  "model": "qwen3:4b"
}

### 2.3 空消息：返回 400 + SSE 错误帧
POST {{host}}/api/chat/stream
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Accept: text/event-stream

{
  "message": ""
}


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### 3. 会话管理 /api/sessions
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### 3.1 列出所有活跃会话
GET {{host}}/api/sessions
Accept: application/json

### 3.2 删除指定会话
DELETE {{host}}/api/sessions/demo-001

### 3.3 删除不存在的会话：返回 404
DELETE {{host}}/api/sessions/not-exist

### 3.4 清空所有会话
DELETE {{host}}/api/sessions

### 测试 SSE 接口，设置超时为 300 秒
// @timeout 300000
POST http://localhost:5324/api/chat/stream
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "用三句话介绍一下上海",
  "sessionId": "rider-sse-test"
}

### 带脚本处理的 SSE 请求
// @timeout 300000
POST http://localhost:5324/api/chat/stream
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "你好",
  "sessionId": "rider-script-test"
}

> {%
    response.body.onEachLine((line) => {
        // ★ 关键：先判空
        if (!line || !line.startsWith("data: ")) return;

        const jsonStr = line.substring(6).trim();
        if (!jsonStr) return;

        try {
            const data = JSON.parse(jsonStr);
            if (data.content && data.content.trim() !== "") {
                client.log(data.content);
            }
            if (data.done) {
                client.log("--- Stream Finished ---");
            }
        } catch (e) {
            // 忽略无法解析的行
        }
    });
%}
